{
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       L3GD20H-Demo.spin2
    Description:    Demo of the L3GD20H driver
        * 3DoF data output
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Jul 11, 2020
    Updated:        Nov 14, 2025
